msgstr ""
":ref:`ワンルームを開き <studio/access>`、必要な:doc:`ビュー <views>`に切り替"
"えます。"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/approval_rules.rst:14
msgid "Select the button for which you want to add approval rules."
msgstr ""

